{
 "data": [
  {
   "uuid": "02a7f68a-5bdd-4887-a256-20c985a65bda",
   "slug": "10-series-greatsword-cannon",
   "name": "10-Series Greatsword Cannon",
   "class_name": "KBAR_BallisticCannon_S2",
   "classification": "Ship.Weapon.Gun",
   "classification_label": "Gun",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "KnightBridge Arms knows that when it comes to battle, having the right weapon can make all the difference. With its powerful ballistic rounds, the versatile, size two 10-Series Greatsword will see you through to the conflict's end thanks to it long range and high damage potential.",
    "de_DE": "Hersteller: KnightBridge Arms\nTyp (En): Ballistic Cannon\nTyp (De): Ballistische Kanone\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S2\n\nKnightBridge Arms wei\u00df, dass es im Kampf auf die richtige Waffe ankommt. Mit seinen leistungsstarken ballistischen Geschossen wird die vielseitige S2-S10-Series Greatsword dich bis zum Ende des Konflikts begleiten, dank ihrer Reichweite und hohen Schadenspotenzials.",
    "zh_CN": "\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u9a91\u58eb\u6865\u519b\u5907 (KnightBridge Arms)\n\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u5b9e\u5f39\u52a0\u519c\u70ae\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a2\n\n\u9a91\u58eb\u6865\u519b\u5907\u660e\u767d\u5728\u6218\u6597\u4e2d\uff0c\u4f7f\u7528\u5408\u9002\u7684\u6b66\u5668\u80fd\u6539\u53d8\u4e00\u5207\u3002\u51ed\u501f\u7740\u5a01\u529b\u5f3a\u5927\u7684\u5b9e\u5f39\u5f39\u836f\uff0c\u957f\u5c04\u7a0b\u548c\u9ad8\u4f24\u5bb3\uff0c\u7075\u6d3b\u591a\u53d8\u7684S2\u6b66\u566810\u7cfb\u5217\u201c\u5927\u5251\u201d\u80fd\u8ba9\u4f60\u5b58\u6d3b\u5230\u6218\u6597\u7684\u7ed3\u675f\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Fabricant: KnightBridge Arms\nType d'article: Canon balistique\nTaille: 2\n\nKnightBridge Arms sait qu'en mati\u00e8re de combat, avoir la bonne arme peut faire toute la diff\u00e9rence. Avec ses puissants projectiles balistiques, le polyvalent Greatsword 10-Series, taille deux, vous accompagnera jusqu'\u00e0 la fin du conflit gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 sa longue port\u00e9e et son potentiel de d\u00e9g\u00e2ts \u00e9lev\u00e9."
   },
