  {
   "uuid": "f03daac4-28e2-405c-b226-c258151cb9f1",
   "slug": "11-series-broadsword-cannon",
   "name": "11-Series Broadsword Cannon",
   "class_name": "KBAR_BallisticCannon_S3",
   "classification": "Ship.Weapon.Gun",
   "classification_label": "Gun",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "The 11-Series Broadsword from KnightBridge Arms is the size three ballistic autocannon pilots come to when they want the 3 D's: distance, dependability and damage.",
    "de_DE": "Hersteller: KnightBridge Arms\nTyp (En): Ballistic Cannon\nTyp (De): Ballistische Kanone\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S3\n\nDie 11-Series Broadsword von KnightBridge Arms ist die S3-ballistische Autokanone, zu der Piloten greifen, wenn sie die 3 Ds wollen: Distanz, Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit und Schaden.",
    "zh_CN": "\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u9a91\u58eb\u6865\u519b\u5907 (KnightBridge Arms)\n\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u5b9e\u5f39\u52a0\u519c\u70ae\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a3\n\n\u9a91\u58eb\u6865\u519b\u5907\u768411\u7cfb\u5217\u201c\u9614\u5251\u201d\u662f\u98de\u884c\u5458\u4eec\u5728\u60f3\u8981\u4fdd\u6301\u5b89\u5168\u8ddd\u79bb\u3001\u53ef\u9760\u6027\u548c\u4f24\u5bb3\u65f6\u9700\u8981\u7684S3\u5b9e\u5f39\u81ea\u52a8\u706b\u70ae\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Fabricant: KnightBridge Arms\nType d'article: Canon balistique\nTaille: 3\n\nLe Broadsword 11-Series de KnightBridge Arms est le canon automatique balistique de taille trois vers lequel les pilotes se tournent lorsqu'ils recherchent : distance, fiabilit\u00e9 et d\u00e9gats."
   },
   "size": 3,
